<h2>Homeowners Insurance Rates Going Up</h2>
<img alt="" class="attachment-full size-full wp-image-9049" height="607" loading="lazy" src="/assets/original/2022/12/221202_frustrated_man.jpg" width="1080">
<p>Homeowners’ insurance rates have been on the rise in recent years.</p>
<h2>The Short Version:</h2>
<ul>
<li>According to a recent report from SafeHome, 43% of homeowners say they have seen an increase in their premiums in the past year.</li>
